A little while ago, someone re-iterated a plea for a "pick up money only"
option.

Well, how about a more general option consisting of symbols to automatically
pick up?
I implemented this in 3.0 last fall, and it's pretty handy.
Sometimes you want to go around picking up just armor; sometimes rings;
sometimes gold; etc.  You can change the option to pick up whatever you
want.
The option was called 'symspickup'.  It was ignored whenever 'pickup'
was on.

Surely this wouldn't be hard to implement in 3.1?
If I have time to do it soon I will, and post a patch.

